  "notes": [
    "The campaign is two copycats replaying the defect: 0x7ec9f769… minted unbacked notes and withdrew bridge wrapper tokens the next morning, 0xc1c5b3c6… did the same a week later. Each of their crediting rollups decodes a deposit after numRealTxs; the earlier processRollup calls since the upgrade settle every decoded tx and are ordinary exits.",
    "Unpriced wrapper tokens are valued at what the copycats realised redeeming them: wcDAI for DAI, wewstETH and weDAI for WETH, DAI and USDC, TB-275 for the ETH the rollup's tranche bridge returned when it was sent back, so that ETH is not counted again. weWETH had no redeemable underlying and is valued at zero."
  ]
